---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About | Africa Startup Finance"
			description="Africa Startup Finance helps founders build practical financial models for planning, fundraising, and growth."
		/>
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />

		<main>
			<section>
				<p>About Africa Startup Finance</p>

				<h1>Helping Founders Understand Their Numbers</h1>

				<p>
					Africa Startup Finance helps startup founders turn business
					assumptions into clear, practical financial models.
				</p>

				<p>
					While the platform has a strong focus on African startups and
					the realities of building businesses across African markets,
					financial modeling support is available to founders beyond Africa as well.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>What I Help With</h2>

				<p>
					The goal is to help founders better understand how their business
					makes money, where cash is going, how long their runway may last,
					and what their future funding needs could look like.
				</p>

				<ul>
					<li>Startup financial modeling</li>
					<li>Revenue and expense forecasting</li>
					<li>Cash flow and runway planning</li>
					<li>Fundraising projections</li>
					<li>Unit economics</li>
					<li>Scenario analysis</li>
					<li>Financial model reviews</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Built With African Startups in Mind</h2>

				<p>
					African startups often operate across different currencies,
					markets, customer segments, funding environments, and economic
					conditions.
				</p>

				<p>
					Africa Startup Finance gives particular attention to these
					realities while applying financial modeling principles that can
					support startups in many different markets.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Work With Me From Anywhere</h2>

				<p>
					Financial modeling work can be handled remotely, so founders do
					not need to be based in the same country or region to work with me.
				</p>

				<p>
					If you are building a startup and need a clearer view of your
					revenue, costs, cash flow, runway, fundraising requirements, or
					growth scenarios, you are welcome to reach out.
				</p>

				<a href="/contact/">Request a Financial Modeling Consultation</a>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Startup Finance Insights</h2>

				<p>
					I also publish practical insights on financial modeling,
					startup finance, fundraising, and funding developments, with
					particular attention to African startup ecosystems.
				</p>

				<a href="/blog/">Explore the latest insights →</a>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>